{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0fd6e5b6f7f1e61f9f6b744c4dc04cc0567a5db3a8667924ea2d094929d181cb", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。響は\nこれから、校庭で部活のシーンを撮影するようだ）", "zh": "（照片杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。接下来似乎要在\n校园里拍摄社团活动的场景了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "598b2acb7e793537be4309ad36f4644be0d73af91176230d388285f4fe2121d6", "ja": "{$P$}、準備はバッチリだぞ！\n野球でもサッカーでも、なんでもやってみせるさー！", "zh": "{$P$}，我已经准备得妥妥的了！\n不管是棒球还是足球，什么我都能试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b9b0303a0dfbd92bab8711cd6d5ef6fbf93300da44ff8935e7ce8410971dbda8", "ja": "おっ、響、さてはものすごくやる気だな？", "zh": "哦，响，看样子你干劲十足啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "aa3a6966e93444ed1486b00f4ba8849b7e6d2deb2508db469d4eb7e8dcb768a6", "ja": "もちろんだぞ！　今日はいろんな部活の写真を撮るって\n聞いてたから、自分、ずっと楽しみにしてたんだ～。", "zh": "那当然啦！听说今天要拍各种社团的照片，\n我就一直非常期待呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6d13f3e97cf279d143f57b4ace5a7d43bcc0b5c35113988ee4cb5fdd2ebf7dfb", "ja": "ということは……\n前からいろんな部活をやってみたかったのか？", "zh": "也就是说……\n你以前就想尝试参加各种社团吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "c0f85897feba1514232996946f07d586aa190b9cc196bbe385be6297dadfb618", "ja": "うん、そうだぞ。でも自分、部活はできないでしょ？\nアイドルの仕事があるし、いぬ美たちも待ってるし。", "zh": "嗯，是这样。不过，我没法参加社团吧？\n毕竟还有偶像的工作，而且小犬美它们也在等着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9abc7f92aee65e04c54fc061d9c9b21cf3ecbb2de42a2a43d8e51ded3be25616", "ja": "それもそうか……。でも、響が本気で部活をやって\nいたら、今ごろ全国大会レベルまで極めていたかもな。", "zh": "确实也是……不过，要是响当初认真参加社团活动，说不定现在已经练到全国大赛的水平了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "e7379223f5fd57821d54baac7d894f7f68835a728d2eed7b2a05512bcb52e192", "ja": "おっ、{$P$}、よくわかってるね？\n実は自分もそう思ってたんだ！", "zh": "哦，{$P$}，你还真懂我啊？\n其实我也这么想过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "e5ffa365da404babb70dbc1ea79e3263ba02bde2c9af7eccdfe683b776f87853", "ja": "でも、もし部活に入るなら……卓球部がいいかな？\n小学校のときは部長もしてたし。", "zh": "不过，要是加入社团的话……我想选乒乓球社吧？\n毕竟我小学时还当过社长呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "96f33d45197bc4226de775fdb4fa7f2d14a3066b0be26936b9ddbb8518b4ca66", "ja": "そうだ、今度自分と卓球で勝負してみない？\n必殺のスネークサーブ、受けてほしいぞ！", "zh": "对了，下次要不要和我比一场乒乓球？\n希望你接下我必杀的蛇球发球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6d90f2029343714d01484bdccb50311f7004ce12c1ccdfcd85ec93a11dd22dc5", "ja": "なんだか、すごく曲がりそうなサーブ名だな。\nもしかして、他にも必殺技があるとか？", "zh": "总觉得这个发球的名字听起来就会拐得很厉害。\n难道说，你还有其他必杀技？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "f756c146e433352a375a80f5ac8d5e96574dda69f20b37e859410d81fb2e2641", "ja": "うん、いっぱい練習もしたからね！　スネークレシーブ\nとか、スネークスピンとか、スネークスマッシュとか！", "zh": "嗯，因为我也进行了大量练习嘛！像是蛇形接球、蛇形旋转、蛇形扣杀之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a2567bd63d94ee564ddbba76fc49d8226f1d77343e7564d248f578dd0e341f62", "ja": "……そうか。\nだいたい曲がるんだな……。", "zh": "……这样啊。\n基本上都会拐弯啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "5e0e2226e725a3f4b760f283922819772af9f751a8483173c3fb3016bf2e85d7", "ja": "うーん……なんか、卓球の話をしてたら、\n今すぐやりたくなってきちゃったぞ……。", "zh": "嗯……怎么说呢，聊着乒乓球，就突然想马上打了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "8979a75cfc018b3ce326748b80f9a44cefe99d459d268f633e98672b162fe132", "ja": "ううっ、ガマンできない！　{$P$}、\n撮影が終わったら、卓球に付き合ってくれる？", "zh": "呜呜，忍不住了！{$P$}，\n拍摄结束后，能陪我打乒乓球吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "66c6bd80c4ef65d52c65a33b61d888f4639077b4a3c209ee2e5d9fc8e847b558", "ja": "いいけど……ゆっくり卓球を楽しむには、\nこの撮影はすぐに終わらせないといけないぞ？", "zh": "行是行……但要想好好打乒乓球的话，\n这次拍摄就得赶快结束才行哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "9f43c25862d7b75cb8daa249ac711aad5e131c211406609336fceb4789138e55", "ja": "それなら大丈夫！　自分のスネークポーズで\n全部一発OK間違いないさー！　あっははは！", "zh": "那就没问题了！靠我的蛇形姿势，肯定能全部一次通过啦——！啊哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0143_1017_p", "source_sha256": "49668c5c5ae4a47634f268bdb46579cacaa5f6145ed48cf32c3a2a49d67f2395", "ja": "（その後、響は宣言通りに一発OKを連発してみせた。\nスネークポーズ……いったい、どれなんだ……？）", "zh": "（之后，响如她所宣言的那样，接连多次一遍通过。蛇形姿势……到底是哪一个啊……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
